---
title: Desktop setup · Run and recheck
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state Result <<choice>>
    state "Needs action" as Action
    state "Password prompt" as Password
    state "No permission" as NoPermission
    state "Done · closing" as Done

    classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
    class Running live
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    class Password wait
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px
    class Failed fail

    [*] --> Action
    Action --> Running : Run
    Running --> Password : sudo requests password
    Password --> Running : Prompt accepted
    Password --> Exited : Refused or cancelled
    Running --> Exited : Command exits
    Exited --> Recheck : Read fresh evidence
    Recheck --> Result
    Result --> Done : Exit 0 and check passes
    Result --> Failed : Command or check failed
    Result --> NoPermission : Admin access refused
    Failed --> Running : Try again
    NoPermission --> [*] : Hand off to admin
    Done --> [*] : Close drawer and advance
